There are two versions of every Conftop-Designfile.

Conftop_XXX_D.dsg are DYNAMIC Designfiles! 
You can change the maximum total number of output-lines by editing the value
"MaxLines=<value>" in the global-field.

Conftop_XXX_S.dsg are STATIC Designfiles!

(Read the doc for more informations about both types)

Always remember to use STATIC designs for the written messages!
